# Optional: your own names for TV Home's input tiles. Copy to inputs.conf (ignored by git), then ./build.sh and
# reinstall. Each line: the TV's name for the port = the name to show, optionally "| a note" for the line under it.
# A renamed tile shows the port's own name small in its corner. (To leave an input off the home screen, hide it in
# TV Home's Settings.)
HDMI 1=Sound bar | Audio
HDMI 2=Games console | Gaming
HDMI 3=Streaming stick | Chromecast
